---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import StaticForm from '../../components/StaticForm.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="CPA contact form" description="A payroll partner CPAs and advisors can feel confident referring.">
	<PageHero title="A payroll partner you can feel confident referring" />
	<section class="section">
		<div class="container split">
			<div>
				<p>Most of the conversations that start here come from a simple place. A client brings up payroll. Maybe something is not being handled the way it should be. Maybe it is creating more follow up than expected.</p>
				<h2>Start the conversation</h2>
				<p>If you have a client in mind, or you simply want to understand how we work before making an introduction, fill out the form.</p>
				<p>No pressure. Just a conversation.</p>
			</div>
			<StaticForm formName="cpa-contact" />
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>